// REQUIRES: long
// The control of Inputs/check-linear.py --power 2 (ops-stress-extover: the
// picks are quadratic by nature): a program cubic in N, at N/8 and N, must be
// reported as over the limit (512 times the cost, limit 192).
// RUN: not %python %S/Inputs/check-linear.py --label control --control %S/Inputs/cubic.py --power 2 --scale 8 --n 560 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: control: near-linear NO
